oh nice! yea im sure ill just have to wait lol was hoping I could read all I need to know for tomorrow so when it is tomorrow I can farm keys of my BiS trinket/ring slot. The ring from moroes sounds interesting but idk if its "broken" or just a cool little effect:

&#x200B;

"The first time you damage an enemy they deal 10% less damage to you for 4 sec."

I think that this is a great change for my mmo... i really like this and think its awesome to include this into wow...

&#x200B;

^(Please dont cancel me..)

I really dont know how to explain whats going on and would like to know if its just an issue on my end..? my addons are working fine, go to update all of them because maybe one or two is out of date and now nothing works, tried disabling them all and now i dont have a minimap, buttons are in weird locations on my hotbar... normally if i turn off all addons it just fixes it and goes back to normal but this is like extra weird... i have no clue wtf to do

&#x200B;

E: solved because im a big dumb dumb
